WEBVTT

00:07:26.579 --> 00:07:31.079
Yeah. So that started a long journey to
work with Dr. Farmer and his team in

00:07:31.079 --> 00:07:36.913
Rwanda. And the first thing that I did
was I met their head engineer,

00:07:36.913 --> 00:07:39.371
an amazing guy named Bruce Noisey,

00:07:40.038 --> 00:07:42.204
and Bruce was leading all
their building projects.

00:07:43.371 --> 00:07:47.163
Airborne diseases are mitigated by
moving more air through the room.

00:07:47.288 --> 00:07:51.371
So I worked with Bruce and
his team and came up with

00:07:51.371 --> 00:07:55.121
the design whose primary goal was to
reduce transmission of infections,

00:07:55.121 --> 00:07:59.288
to create all the waiting areas in the
exterior, or to think about airflow,

00:07:59.288 --> 00:08:01.163
basically to remove all hallways,